# The canary for every-address-opens.rq: a file of ours that names one
# address no published file defines and drift-king.org does not serve. A
# canary is read alone, so it carries what the check reads from the model:
# the rdfs:isDefinedBy the-builder records, and the folder drift-king.org is
# served from. The check must find the address.
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix dcat:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .

<https://drift-king.org/site/public/> a dcat:Distribution ;
    dcat:accessURL <https://drift-king.org/> .
<https://drift-king.org/not-ah/canary/every-address-opens/step>
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://drift-king.org/the-linter/canaries/every-address-opens.ttl> ;
    dcterms:references <https://drift-king.org/not-ah/canary/every-address-opens/nowhere> .
